config BR2_PACKAGE_BRCMFMAC_BCM4319
	bool "brcmfmac with BCM4319 support (out of tree)"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  The kernel's own brcmfmac, built out of tree with the BCM4319
	  (an older Sonics-backplane SDIO chip) added: its SDIO id, its
	  firmware name and a generic SB core scan. Replaces the in-tree
	  brcmfmac module. The firmware is not shipped; the board copies
	  it off its own stock partition.

comment "brcmfmac-bcm4319 needs a Linux kernel"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
